---
description: Docker / runtime versions for miyi-app
globs:
  - "Dockerfile"
  - "docker-compose*.yml"
  - "docker/**/*"
---

- Base image is pinned to **`php:7.4.7-fpm`**. Do not bump PHP in Dockerfile without a coordinated Laravel/dependency upgrade.
- Composer is copied from **`composer:2.2`** (LTS compatible with PHP 7.2+).
- Xdebug is pinned to **3.1.6** (compatible with PHP 7.4).
- Required PHP extensions in the image: `pdo_mysql`, `zip`, `gd`, `mbstring`, `bcmath`, `exif`, `opcache`, `pcntl` (plus defaults).
- `docker-compose.local.yml` uses **MariaDB 10.5**; app mounts the project at `/var/www/html` and uses a **named volume** `miyi_vendor` for `/var/www/html/vendor` so dependencies persist across `docker compose run`.
- If `apt-get update` fails on old Debian, switch APT sources to `archive.debian.org` (see commented line in Dockerfile).
